      "retrievedAt": "2026-10-17",
      "notes": "Installed Function_Interior_A350/model/A350_Interior.behavior.xml SHA256 886c885ce5ee2480740fafed75c5d38fcca6d4cc8bd77b9b391556b58744b2fb. The cockpit wheel calls AIRLINER_Flaps_Inc / AIRLINER_Flaps_Dec with 16384 divided by FLAPS NUM HANDLE POSITIONS; these invoke AIRLINER_FLAPS and INI.FLAPS_SET. FlightFabric follows that wheel sequence, independently confirming each 25-percent FLAPS HANDLE PERCENT detent, at most four steps. Direct target jumps left the A350-1000 at FULL after selecting 1; the stepped FULL-to-1 route restored cockpit 1+F on 2026-10-17. AIRLINER_LDG_AUTO_BRK triggers INI_AUTOBRAKE_ARMED_CMD; independent INI_AUTOBRAKE_ARMED confirms arm/disarm with fresh same-target no-op protection. Manual 1.5 pages 65-67 requires runway/exit setup for BTV. -1000 lever, autobrake and restoration checks passed; -900, airborne transitions and actual landing braking remain pending. See docs/A350-PROFILE-VALIDATION.md."
